sequenceDiagram
    actor R1 as Receptionist R1
    actor Doc as Dr. Example One
    actor Acc as Accountant
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Lab as Example Dental Lab
    participant Jobs as Worker jobs
    Doc->>Web: Open My Queue, Start my queue
    Web->>API: start queue session
    R1->>Web: Book Sample Patient A
    Web->>API: POST /appointments
    R1->>Web: Check in and get token
    Web->>API: PATCH /appointments/:id/check-in
    API-->>R1: Token and printable ticket
    Doc->>Web: Call next
    Web->>API: POST /queue/sessions/:id/call-next
    Doc->>Web: Patient is here, start
    Web->>API: PATCH /queue/entries/:id/start-consultation
    API-->>Doc: Encounter created, workspace opens
    Doc->>Web: Notes, treatments, prescription
    Doc->>Web: Sign and print prescription
    Doc->>Web: Complete visit
    Web->>API: PATCH /queue/entries/:id/complete
    API-->>R1: Charges ready to bill
    Doc->>Web: Create and submit lab order
    Web->>API: POST /lab-orders and submit
    Lab->>API: Accept order in lab portal
    R1->>Web: Billing desk, Bill, Receive
    Web->>API: POST /payments
    API-->>R1: Receipt and invoice issued
    Acc->>Web: Close counter
    Doc->>Web: Close day
    Jobs->>API: Overnight checks and cleanup
